!Sources/MacActionScheduler/Resources/Fonts/.keep

# Secrets and signing material (never commit private keys or identities).
*.p12
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
*.mobileprovision
.env
.env.*

# Misc
.netrc
*.backup
.local-backups/
.icon-tools-venv/
